CollapseReason.description:
Why a file's patch body was withheld from a `DiffFile` (see `collapsed`).
Distinct from `patch_truncated`, which marks a patch too large to ever send;
a `collapsed` file's patch is fetchable on demand via `GET .../diff-file`.

ComponentUpgradeImpact.description:
What moving every pipeline that uses the component onto one published version would involve.
The counts and entries cover the pipelines you can read, up to the number one report examines;
`truncated` says when there were more.

oneOf.description:
The environment's protection. When absent, a `production` environment requires one approval
from the people given access on the owning group and deploys only from the default branch;
other tiers are left unprotected.

